          <div id="faq-1" class="accordion-content">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              <p>Yes. StopReg classifies <strong><%= (typeof selectedDomain !=='undefined' && selectedDomain) ? selectedDomain : 'this domain' %></strong> as a disposable email domain that provides temporary email addresses. Addresses from this domain may be used for short-term registrations and may increase the risk of fake signups or free-trial abuse.</p>
            </div>
